<h3>Pro Tips: Mahadev Shivling Ai Photo Editing Prompt</h3>
<p>Always paste your reference photo first, then drop the prompt. Gemini Nano Banana Pro reads the image before the text, so the face lock works much better when the reference is already loaded.</p>
<p>If skin texture looks too smooth on first generation, add visible open pores, natural micro skin texture, no beauty filter applied right after the face lock line and regenerate once.</p>
<p>Run each prompt 3 times minimum. The third generation almost always has the cleanest facial match and the most accurate fabric detail.</p>
<p>Aspect Ratio: 3:4 Vertical — works best for Instagram grid posts, Pinterest pins, and WhatsApp DP crops.</p>
